{"detail": {"templateUuid": "78217ba8ae374f00a03d82df4299a4b7", "projectUuid": "ff8d2b2e78dd4f36afb05fcba11e981e", "name": "“是否有末班地铁能带你逃离这一切？” - 《末班地铁》", "description": "《末班地铁》是【关于陆仁贾的99种死亡】系列的第一部短片，本片讲述人到中年的老陆，职场难敌新人锋芒，为养家夜夜加班。他踏入末班地铁，困在宿命之中，如缸中金鱼，看得见天光，却不甘困于方寸。陆仁贾，人海里最平凡的普通人，他的故事，就此开启。《末班地铁》作为系列片的开启，我们聚焦千千万万的“陆仁贾”，为失语者呐喊、为失意者助力。没有谁是不重要的路人甲，你我都是各自命运中不可替代的主角!  我们也想借由此片，为那些尚在鱼缸里挣扎的人多一份祝愿好好活下去!", "coverUrl": "/assets/fcfc3176ab23ab06.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/5087b8992a414500a5067466ccecc650/1dedc78d5221dd1c27e481b228ec98b7a6e64886.mp4", "snapshotId": 44690, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 10356256, "ownerUuid": "5087b8992a414500a5067466ccecc650", "avatar": "/assets/d731ac95ba47dfd4.webp", "nickname": "Felix程", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 52, "tags": [{"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3057, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "一场戏的诞生 ", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3059, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2. 消失的TA", "parentTag": 3057, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3057/3059", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://xhslink.cn/o/7bN37nI4be0", "createAt": "2026年09月09日 11:56", "updateAt": "2026年09月17日 20:00", "publishAt": "2026年09月09日 17:14", "playCount": 409, "viewCreationProcessCount": 142, "copyCanvasCount": 21, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/78217ba8ae374f00a03d82df4299a4b7.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 337, "edges": 309}}, "recommendList": []}